   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ingredients and quantities",
   "texto": [
    "**Oppskrift** means «recipe». In Norwegian, the measures are usually followed by the name of the ingredient without article: **to desiliter vann** («two decitres of water»).",
    "**En halv** means «medium / a» and **litt** expresses a small amount; it is not used as the Spanish «a little bit of» with a preposition."
   ]
